      "description": "Welcome to Module 1! This month you'll master AWS fundamentals.\n\nGoals:\n- Complete Udemy AWS SAA course sections 1-5\n- Deploy a 3-tier web app manually (EC2, RDS, S3)\n- Create 50+ Anki cards on AWS services\n- Start LeetCode (Arrays & Hashing pattern)\n\nSetup tasks:\n- [ ] Create AWS free tier account\n- [ ] Install AWS CLI and configure credentials\n- [ ] Set up Terraform on your machine\n- [ ] Create GitHub repo: aws-3tier-webapp\n- [ ] Start LeetCode tracking spreadsheet\n\nResources:\n- Udemy: Ultimate AWS Certified Solutions Architect Associate\n- AWS Free Tier: https://aws.amazon.com/free/\n- Terraform docs: https://terraform.io/docs\n",
